### Manual Verification
- QR scan flow: Generate invite → Scan → OTP → Register → Pending approval
- Trip management: Start duty → Start trip → Navigate → Complete trip → End duty
- Location tracking: Verify GPS data flows to backend
- Offline mode: Disable network → Create expense → Re-enable → Verify sync
- WebSocket: Assign vehicle in dashboard → Verify driver app updates
- SOS: Trigger emergency → Verify fleet manager notification
- Document upload: Upload license → Verify stored in backend
